SUMMARY:St Catharine's Political Economy Seminar - Professor Shailaja Fenne
 ll - Revisiting Economic Security: an investigation of concepts and measur
 es for the present day
LOCATION:The Ramsden Room\, St Catharine's College
URL:https://talks.cam.ac.uk/talk/index/273722/
CATEGORIES:Politics,International
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Professor Shailaja Fennell\, Uiversity of Cambridge\nS
 t Catharine's Political Economy Seminar Series\nTopics: Politics\, Interna
 tional\nDetails: https://talks.cam.ac.uk/talk/index/273722/\nSpeaker: Prof
 essor Shailaja Fennell\n Talk Title: Revisiting Economic Security: an inve
 stigation of concepts and measures for the present day\n Time: 18:00 -19:3
 0 \n Location: Ramsden room\, St Catharine's College \n The seminar series
  is supported by the Cambridge Political Economy Society and the Economics
  and Policy Group at the Cambridge Judge Business School. \n\n Speaker Ove
 rview: \n Shailaja Fennell is Professor of Economic Security and Resilienc
 e in the Department of Land Economy. She obtained her B.A\, M. A. and M.Ph
 il. in Economics from Delhi University\, before coming to the University o
 f Cambridge to obtain another M.Phil. and then her PhD. in Economics at th
 e Faculty of Economics. She is a fellow of Jesus College\, and also Direct
 or of the Centre of South Asian Studies.
